	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil omnino nunc, quod scribam, habeo; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nihil vel ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> vel ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>accipio, nisi quod miles in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> ducendus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>colligitur in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> a comite Archio, Ladrono <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Alberto, Empseo etc.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Alii aiunt <persName ref="p8282">Maximilianum</persName> nolle, ut <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vacuetur <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> militibus ducanturque (ducendi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>in <placeName ref="l882">Hungariam</placeName>) in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quid sit, nescio; ubi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>certi aliquid habuero, scribam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Mitto 12 ex[em]p<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>la sumptibus magistratus vobis parata, distribuite <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vos illa, prout caussae putatis profuturum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ex publi<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cis literis reliqua intelligetis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Dum literas complicaturus et obsignaturus eram, en <placeName ref="l646">Clarona</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ad me per Beldium tuae mittuntur; legi nec si<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ne dolore.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod inscriptionem aut subscriptionem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>attinet, spero te nihil habere, quod conqueraris; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>it<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>a enim scripsi, ut tuis in literis scribere iussisti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>aliquid mutatum cupis, significa in tempore; nam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>recudetur paucos post dies.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quod infelix dissidium <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>attinet episcopale, quid consilii dem, non habeo.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Si ea media reciperent adversarii, quae in consultatione <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>proponuntur, tollerabilis esset res; sed vere<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>or tale nihil ipsos recepturos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Wenn ir sy in den <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>banden hättend, möchtend ir inen schier nitt me zuͦ<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>muͦten.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quemadmodum vero horum hominum mores mihi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>noti sunt, ita metuo illos pertinaciter inhaesuros <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>proposito iuri <foreign xml:lang="de">und das sy äben mitt rächt wöllind <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>die sach ußgemacht haben.</foreign></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Plausibilis caussa: qui enim <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>stare noluerit iuri, omnes habebit sibi infensos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et hostes.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scio, quid amplissimae reipublicae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> even<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>erit semel et iterum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Difficile impetrabitur <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>a nostris vel aliis evangelicis Urbibus, ut scribant <placeName>2 <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Foederibus</placeName> ac petant ab eis, ne iure agatur etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Rursus, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>si iure agitur, metuo privilegia, quibus vos nitimini, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ut inania reiicienda.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Scio iam hoc quoque: <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>non vobis dumtaxat frenum sic imponi, sed et ca<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>pistrum nobis quoque parari.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">ideo mature monueram, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>et quidem, cuius ex instinctu, nosti, si recte meministi: <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>utilissimum fore, si Domus Dei curaret alia <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName>2 Foedera</placeName> sibi in hac caussa devincere.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sed hoc obt<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ineri non potuit; caussas scis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quid ergo nunc con<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>sulam, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominum orabo, ut is se in[terponat].</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Interim, si tollerabili transactione res comp[o<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>neretur], qua et religioni et libertati caveretur, existimo, [es<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>set] minime aspernandum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Consultationem <persName>Beldio</persName> misi.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Prius monui et iam repeto: si Domus Dei aliquid fieri <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>velit a nostris, hoc non per tuas privatas literas et meam expositionem <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>esse indicandum.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Non prodest caussae, si per te vel me <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>haec tententur.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Scribat unus et alter in magistratu constitutus <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ad d. consulem et privatim moneat, quid facto opus sit.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Et iam nunc redeo a consule <persName>M[ullnero]</persName>, cui tuas tradidi literas, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>et caussam tuam ei commendavi; simul exposui vel <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>recitavi ea, quae tu ad me etc.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Placeret illi transactio <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>t<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ollerabilis, et in hoc mavult vos laborare totos quam bellum <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>experiri.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">De literis scribendis ad <placeName>2 Foedera</placeName>, ne iure <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>hoc negotium terminent, dixit ille quoque, quod antea monui, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>nullam esse spem.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">- Literas cum chartis Italicis misi ad <persName>Zieglerum</persName><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iam vale.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Dominus benedicat tibi et servet te a malo.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta consules et fratres.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">15. martii 1566<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Tuus ex animo totus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Fessus sum iam usque scribendo <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l210">Heydelbergam</placeName>, <placeName>Martburgum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l167">Ge<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>nevam</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Praes<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>tantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro fideli, do<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>mino et fratri meo colendo et dilecto.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>